CHAPTER.VERS:
And, look, Boaz came from Bethlehem, and said to the reapers, Yahweh be with you

          {+}
        . And they answered him, Yahweh bless you.

And she said, Let me glean, I pray you

          {+}
        , and gather after the reapers among the sheaves. So she came, and has remained standing from morning until now; her sitting now in the house [has only been] for a moment.
